## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Entry Points"
        CRON[Cron Trigger]
        USER[User Intent]
        EVENT[External Event]
    end
    
    subgraph "Orchestration Layer"
        ORCH[Orchestrator]
        TRIGGERS[Neural Triggers]
        META[Meta-Optimizer]
    end
    
    subgraph "Factory Layer"
        FACTORY[Context Factory]
        AGENTS[Agent Definitions]
    end
    
    subgraph "Agent Layer (Ephemeral)"
        SYN[Synthesizer]
        CRITIC[Critic]
        DEV[Developer]
        RES[Researcher]
        ARCH[Architect]
        STRAT[Strategist]
        LIB[Librarian]
        OPS[DevOps]
    end
    
    subgraph "Capability Layer"
        BRAIN[Brain Ops]
        RENDER[Render Ops]
        DEPTH[Depth Tracker]
        PROOF[Proof System]
    end
    
    CRON --> ORCH
    USER --> FACTORY
    EVENT --> TRIGGERS
    ORCH --> TRIGGERS
    TRIGGERS --> FACTORY
    FACTORY --> AGENTS
    FACTORY --> SYN & CRITIC & DEV & RES & ARCH & STRAT & LIB & OPS
    SYN & CRITIC & DEV & RES --> BRAIN
    ARCH --> DEPTH
    LIB --> PROOF
    OPS --> RENDER
    META -.->|72h| AGENTS
```

