## Marketplace Potential

The architecture now supports:
```python
# Load third-party agent definition
external_prompt = factory.load_external_agent("/path/to/marketplace/agent.md")

# Create context with external agent
context = factory.create_context_for_persona(
    session_id="ext-001",
    persona_name="custom",
    intent="Execute custom task",
    external_prompt=external_prompt
)
```

**Business Model:**
- NAR = Open source runtime (the platform)
- Agent definitions = Shareable/sellable apps
- Brain = Personal context (never shared)

